[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26580.788, "timestamp": "07:23:00", "text": "去年，去年就像是最后一年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26583.75, "timestamp": "07:23:03", "text": "一年就像那只小猫一样。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26586.15, "timestamp": "07:23:06", "text": "可惜她去世了，但今年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26588.708, "timestamp": "07:23:08", "text": "不过我会把它送给我最喜欢的猫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26591.91, "timestamp": "07:23:11", "text": "乔，这些动物。你不喜欢它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26596.39, "timestamp": "07:23:16", "text": "太多了。我给我们的卡查玛很小"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26600.15, "timestamp": "07:23:20", "text": "一些零碎的东西，他就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26605.03, "timestamp": "07:23:25", "text": "再给我一些。它开始咬我的腿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26608.07, "timestamp": "07:23:28", "text": "我当时就想，“好吧，行，拿去吧。”我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26610.19, "timestamp": "07:23:30", "text": "给予一个大"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26613.83, "timestamp": "07:23:33", "text": "一部分原因是它们像甜食一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26615.15, "timestamp": "07:23:35", "text": "我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26618.31, "timestamp": "07:23:38", "text": "知道。窒息是有毒的。这是。我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26619.39, "timestamp": "07:23:39", "text": "知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26622.59, "timestamp": "07:23:42", "text": "但是，是的，当时我正在吃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26625.91, "timestamp": "07:23:45", "text": "巧克力，显然它从我身上掉了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26628.39, "timestamp": "07:23:48", "text": "手。然后，那个新人就在附近，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26632.19, "timestamp": "07:23:52", "text": "就像是，“我是个舔 ..."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26635.67, "timestamp": "07:23:55", "text": "嗯。”忍者。你好，好久不见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26637.468, "timestamp": "07:23:57", "text": "怎样"}]